    % Header
    \begin{center}
        {\LARGE \textbf{Nick Clarke}}\\
        \vspace{1mm}
        Oakland, CA \quad $\vert$ \quad nickolasclarke@gmail.com\\
        \vspace{2mm}
        I am a technical product leader and engineer with 16+ years designing, building, and shipping computational products for the electric grid and environmental monitoring. I have taken monitoring, optimization, and forecasting products from research to production such as DER optimal dispatch and sizing, techno-economic analysis, and load forecasting. I have led product for platforms used by top-tier US utilities, grid operators, and Fortune 500 clients, with a grounding in power systems, energy markets, and modeling from a UC Berkeley MS (Energy \& Resources) as a member of the Energy Modeling, Analysis and Control Group.\\
